T*
(Salsa chicken \(our favorite\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Place 2 lb chicken breasts in the cooker, sprinkle with a packet of taco seasoning, then) Tj
T*
(add a 16 oz jar of salsa and a can of drained black beans. Cook on low 6 to 7 hours or) Tj
T*
(high 3 to 4. Shred and serve in tortillas, over rice or on baked potatoes. The) Tj
T*
(full recipe is on the main page) Tj
